  "title": "Greek Spinach Rice (Spanakorizo)",
  "description": "Bursting with fresh herbs, tangy feta cheese, and fresh lemon flavor, Chef John&#39;s Greek spinach rice is perfect as a side dish or vegetarian main course.",
