    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make Greek spinach rice, also known as spanakorizo. The ingredients needed include spinach, rice, green onions, dill, mint, and lemon juice. He explains that frozen spinach works well and is cheaper than fresh, and medium grain rice is the best choice. Chef John demonstrates how to prepare and cook the dish, mixing the ingredients together and simmering them for 25 minutes. He then adds lemon juice and feta cheese as toppings, giving the dish a creamy texture and tangy flavor that makes it a perfect main course or side dish.",
